# Allowlist for scripts/ci-guards/pre/no-dashes.sh --all (CLAUDE.md section 11).
#
# One line per file: path|max|category|reason
#   max       ceiling on the number of lines in the file that hold an em-dash or
#             en-dash. The file fails when it holds more, so a kept dash cannot
#             spread. Lower the number when you remove one.
#   category  append-only | checksummed | data
#   reason    why the dash stays; required.
# Everything else in the tree must hold no em-dash and no en-dash.

